+    """`git config user.name` in `cwd`, asked once per process for each state of the config files it reads.
+
+    A build asks once per annotation when no loom author name is set; the key is the mtimes of the global and XDG git configs and of the repository's own, so a name changed while `loom serve` runs is still seen (an `include.path` file is not watched).
+    """
+    stamp = _git_config_stamp(cwd)
